<h3>Box Office</h3>
Penerimaan.
Box Office.
Film ini meraup US$29.893.636 di seluruh dunia.
<h3>Penerimaan kritikus</h3>
Penerimaan kritikus.
Ulasan untuk film ini umumnya positif. Niels Matthijs dari Twitch Film memberi film ini ulasan yang positif, dia mengatakan,"Visually Crows Zero II is still looking incredibly slick. Maybe not as many landmark shots, but the dense and graffiti-laden backgrounds make for a tasty looking film alright. The fighting scenes are still a blast to behold too, with strong, intense and action-driven camera work and some tight editing to keep the adrenaline flowing." Demikian pula, Mark Schilling dari The Japan Times memberi film ini 3.5 dari 5 bintang, dia mengatakan,"Miike directs with an energy, velocity and cheeky bravado that are pure punk. He also understands why his Suzuran toughs fight as easily as they breathe - it's not just a release for their raging hormones, but a way of being with their friends and telling the world they exist."
<h2>Sekuel dan adaptasi</h2>
Sekuel dan adaptasi.
Film ini mendapatkan sebuah sekuel berjudul Crows Explode pada 2014. Ia juga diadaptasi ke dalam sebuah manga berjudul oleh pengarang Crows yakni Hiroshi Takahashi, dengan bab individu yang dipublikasikan di majalah Bessatsu Shonen Champion.
